  ('ny17-conley', 'm4a', 2, 'BallotReady profile and River Journal questionnaire: Conley will "create a public option to lower healthcare premiums" and will "reinstate ACA tax credits, repeal Medicaid cuts... and fight for a public option." Public option matches level 2, above the 1 previously stored.', 'https://www.ballotready.org/people/cait-conley', true),
  ('ny17-conley', 'no_corp_pac', 2, 'FEC Schedule E: VoteVets spent $2.15M and New Democrat Majority $1.05M supporting her, with $3.0M spent against her by Progressive Champions PAC. DMFI PAC recorded a nominal $382. Her committee reports $4.32M in receipts, 9.8% from other political committees and $707K unitemized. Refuses corporate PAC money while benefiting from substantial super PAC support: level 2.', 'https://www.fec.gov/data/independent-expenditures/', false),
