  ('pa03-rabb', 'gnd', 4, 'Platform and record: Green New Deal supporter who fought fracking interests in the Pennsylvania House. Green New Deal by name per prior file; phaseout language not separately retrieved.', 'https://www.chrisrabb.com/platform', true),
  ('pa03-rabb', 'justice', 4, 'Sponsored Pennsylvania bills to end cash bail and qualified immunity. Both level 4 markers in his own legislation.', 'https://www.cityandstatepa.com/prediction-markets/candidates/chris-rabb', true),
  ('pa03-rabb', 'labor', 3, 'Union-backed; PRO Act supporter per prior file; WHYY notes the CPC definition he runs on includes union-friendly labor law and a $15-plus wage. PRO Act support not retrieved in his own words.', 'https://whyy.org/articles/3rd-congressional-district-democratic-primary-gaza-progressive/', true),
  ('pa03-rabb', 'm4a', 4, 'WHYY: the Congressional Progressive Caucus and local activists backed Rabb, "who supports Medicare for All"; DSA pledged to fight alongside him to win Medicare for All. Named directly.', 'https://whyy.org/articles/3rd-congressional-district-democratic-primary-gaza-progressive/', false),
  ('pa03-rabb', 'no_corp_pac', 4, 'Endorsed by DSA, WFP, Justice Democrats-aligned groups, Track AIPAC and PAL PAC; campaign refuses corporate PAC money and made rejecting AIPAC a centrepiece. $4.4M in outside spending supported him.', 'https://www.jta.org/2026/05/19/politics/with-aoc-backing-and-anti-israel-message-chris-rabb-vies-for-open-house-seat-in-philadelphia', true),
