  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'abortion', 3, 'BallotReady: "Peggy supports passing the Women''s Health Protection Act to restore the protections of Roe v. Wade, and expand access to abortion for women in every state," plus IVF coverage; helped codify abortion rights in Minnesota in 2023. WHPA by name plus a state codification record; Hyde repeal not named.', 'https://www.ballotready.org/people/peggy-flanagan-9d6742e7-0fc7-4943-8a25-a9737d2ba80c', false),
  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'gaza', 4, 'Campaign priorities page, her own words: "Peggy would have joined Minnesota Senators Smith and Klobuchar in voting to halt offensive weapons sales to Israel," calls for a lasting ceasefire, surging aid to Gaza and a two-state solution; her campaign says what happened in Gaza is genocide and she rejects AIPAC money. Raised from 3 to 4: campaigns on blocking offensive arms transfers and refuses AIPAC. JTA notes she has not opposed funding for defensive systems like Iron Dome.', 'https://peggyflanagan.com/priorities/', false),
  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'labor', 4, 'Smarter.vote: "a $17 federal minimum wage tied to inflation, national paid family and medical leave, universal childcare"; central to Minnesota''s 2023 paid leave package. Meets the $17 wage element of level 4; PRO Act not named in retrieved material.', 'https://smarter.vote/races/mn-senate-2026/peggy-flanagan/', true),
  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'm4a', 3, 'Prior file: supports single payer in principle and backed a MinnesotaCare public option; campaign guide lists affordable health care. Retained, provisional.', 'https://mamdanimovement.com/blogs/mamdani-movement/peggy-flanagan-for-u-s-senate-minnesota-2026-campaign-guide', true),
  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'no_corp_pac', 3, 'Campaign priorities: restrict corporate and dark money, require donor disclosure; no corporate PAC pledge per prior file. $1.4M in outside spending supported her.', 'https://mamdanimovement.com/blogs/mamdani-movement/peggy-flanagan-for-u-s-senate-minnesota-2026-campaign-guide', true),
  ('sen-mn-flanagan', 'tax', 3, 'Smarter.vote: raise the Social Security income cap; backed Minnesota''s 2023 tax increases on high earners and corporations as lieutenant governor. Higher taxes on top earners; no wealth tax by name.', 'https://smarter.vote/races/mn-senate-2026/peggy-flanagan/', true),
