  ('sen-nh-pappas', 'abortion', 3, 'Cosponsors H.R.12, the Women''s Health Protection Act of 2025, H.R.4099, the Ensuring Women''s Right to Reproductive Freedom Act, H.R.1742 on servicemember access and H.R.211 on contraception for veterans. WHPA plus access expansion; Hyde repeal not found.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/chris-pappas/P000614', false),
  ('sen-nh-pappas', 'gaza', 2, 'Cosponsors both H.R.1229, the United States-Israel Defense Partnership Act, and H.Res.473 calling for urgent humanitarian aid to Gaza. Raised from 1 to 2: supports humanitarian access while backing continued defense cooperation with no arms conditions.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/chris-pappas/P000614', true),
  ('sen-nh-pappas', 'm4a', 1, 'Backs a public option and ACA protections; opposes Medicare for All. Cosponsors rural health and marketplace bills. Public option framing only.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/chris-pappas/P000614', true),
  ('sen-nh-pappas', 'no_corp_pac', 2, 'Does not accept corporate PAC money per his campaign; $6.9M in outside spending supported him. Pledge alongside heavy super PAC support.', 'https://www.chrispappas.org/', true),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'antitrust', 3, 'Cosponsors S.130, the Competition and Antitrust Law Enforcement Reform Act, S.1879, the Ban Congressional Stock Trading Act, and sponsors the Privacy Act Modernization Act and Youth AI Privacy Act. Antitrust enforcement plus a stock ban; private equity and crypto regulation not found by name.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/edward-markey/M000133', false),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'democracy', 4, 'Sponsored the Judiciary Act to expand the Supreme Court and has called for ending the filibuster; in the 119th cosponsors S.2523, the John R. Lewis Voting Rights Advancement Act, and S.1814 and S.5121 on Court ethics. Court reform plus filibuster abolition.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/edward-markey/M000133', true),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'gaza', 4, 'Voted Yea on the motion to discharge S.J.Res.34, blocking a $675.7 million offensive arms sale to Israel, July 30, 2025 (rejected 24-73).', 'https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1191/vote_119_1_00455.htm', false),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'gnd', 4, 'Co-author of the Green New Deal resolution with Ocasio-Cortez; in the 119th Congress sponsors or cosponsors S.2444, the End Polluter Welfare Act, S.25, the Polluters Pay Climate Fund Act, S.5284, the Green New Deal for Public Housing Act, and S.4337, the No Big Fossil Bailouts on Your Power Bill Act. Green New Deal plus ending subsidies.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/edward-markey/M000133', false),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'm4a', 4, 'Original cosponsor of S.1506, the Medicare for All Act (2025-04-29).', 'https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-bill/1506/cosponsors', false),
  ('sen-ma-markey', 'no_corp_pac', 3, 'Has refused corporate PAC money since his 2020 primary against Kennedy. Pledge on record; $2.2M in outside spending supported him.', 'https://www.markey.senate.gov/', true),
