  ('sen-ne-osborn', 'no_corp_pac', 4, 'The Nation: campaigns against billionaire-bought politics; refuses corporate PAC money and founded the Working Class Heroes Fund. Ricketts attacked him at the Sept. 1 debate over dark money and out-of-state donors. $1.4M in outside spending supported him.', 'https://www.thenation.com/article/politics/dan-osborn-interview-senate-race-2026/', true),
