  ('gov-ny-hochul', 'housing', 2, 'Signed a Good Cause eviction law in the 2024 budget that tenant groups called watered down, alongside pro-supply incentives; a 2025 package strengthened renter protections. Supply plus limited tenant protection.', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/04/15/nyregion/hochul-budget-housing-deal.html', true),
