  ('gov-ga-bottoms', 'justice', 2, 'As Atlanta mayor signed 2020 use-of-force reforms after the Rayshard Brooks killing, then supported the public safety training center funding that became Cop City. Mixed: reform then expansion.', 'https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/04/keisha-lance-bottoms-a-look-at-the-ajcs-coverage/', true),
  ('gov-ga-bottoms', 'm4a', 1, 'Medicaid expansion is her signature health pledge; as a Biden surrogate opposed single payer. Coverage expansion within the existing system.', 'https://georgiarecorder.com/2026/05/19/former-atlanta-mayor-keisha-lance-bottoms-wins-democratic-nomination-for-georgia-governor/', true),
  ('gov-ga-bottoms', 'no_corp_pac', 1, 'Corporate donor base; no pledge.', 'https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/04/keisha-lance-bottoms-a-look-at-the-ajcs-coverage/', true),
  ('gov-ga-esteves', 'm4a', 2, 'Medicaid expansion.', null, true),
  ('gov-ga-esteves', 'no_corp_pac', 2, 'No corporate PAC pledge.', null, true),
  ('gov-oh-acton', 'abortion', 3, 'Backed Ohio''s 2023 Issue 1 enshrining abortion rights in the state constitution; Signal Ohio: standard Democratic positions on abortion rights. State constitutional codification.', 'https://signalohio.org/amy-acton-ohio-medicaid-voter-id-transgender-athletes-positions-november-election-2026/', true),
  ('gov-oh-acton', 'm4a', 2, 'Former state health director who backs a public option and Medicaid protection; Signal Ohio reports she supports Medicaid work requirements, which cuts against this. Held at 2, flagged.', 'https://signalohio.org/amy-acton-ohio-medicaid-voter-id-transgender-athletes-positions-november-election-2026/', true),
  ('gov-oh-acton', 'no_corp_pac', 2, 'Campaign says it does not accept corporate PAC money; outside spending in the race is heavy on both sides.', 'https://www.amyactonforohio.com/', true),
  ('gov-fl-jolly', 'democracy', 3, 'Spent his years as an independent organizing on ending gerrymandering, open primaries and campaign finance reform; campaign platform lists democracy reform. Campaign finance plus anti-gerrymandering; no Citizens United amendment or filibuster position.', 'https://davidjolly.com/about-david/', true),
  ('gov-fl-jolly', 'm4a', 1, 'Supports Medicaid expansion and ACA protections; former Republican, no public option or single payer position.', 'https://davidjolly.com/', true),
  ('gov-fl-jolly', 'no_corp_pac', 2, 'Longtime campaign finance reform advocate; no explicit corporate PAC refusal found for this race.', 'https://davidjolly.com/about-david/', true),
  ('gov-ia-sand', 'antitrust', 3, 'As state auditor pursued waste and no-bid corporate contracts; Accountability for All platform bans politician stock trading and targets corporate influence. Enforcement record plus a stock ban; no breakup position.', 'https://iowastatedaily.com/338540/news/meet-the-gubernatorial-candidate-state-auditor-rob-sand/', true),
  ('gov-ia-sand', 'justice', 2, 'Accountability for All platform: legalize and tax adult-use cannabis, paired with mandatory prison time for tax thieves and pro-gun-rights messaging. Cannabis legalization meets level 2; raised from 1.', 'https://iowastatedaily.com/338540/news/meet-the-gubernatorial-candidate-state-auditor-rob-sand/', true),
  ('gov-ia-sand', 'm4a', 1, 'Opposes single payer; campaigns as a moderate on protecting Medicaid and rural hospitals.', 'https://www.predictionedge.com/elections/profile/rob-sand/', true),
  ('gov-ia-sand', 'no_corp_pac', 1, 'Record-setting fundraising including corporate donors; no pledge.', 'https://iowastartingline.com/news/elections/iowa-governor-rob-sand-zach-lahn/', true),
  ('gov-nv-ford', 'justice', 3, 'As Senate majority leader passed Nevada''s 2019 AB 236 sentencing reform; as attorney general backed reentry and diversion programs. Sentencing reform record; no qualified immunity or bail position.', 'https://www.leg.state.nv.us/App/NELIS/REL/80th2019/Bill/6418/Overview', true),
  ('gov-nv-ford', 'm4a', 2, 'Nevada passed a state public option in 2021 (SB 420), which he supported as attorney general; campaigns on protecting it. Public option.', 'https://www.leg.state.nv.us/App/NELIS/REL/81st2021/Bill/8100/Overview', true),
  ('gov-nv-ford', 'no_corp_pac', 1, 'Accepts corporate money; no pledge.', 'https://aaronfordfornevada.com/', true),
  ('gov-me-pingree', 'gnd', 3, 'Co-chaired the Maine Climate Council and led the Maine Won''t Wait plan targeting carbon neutrality by 2045; endorsed by Maine Conservation Voters. State climate plan with targets; no fossil fuel phaseout by name.', 'https://www.maineconservation.org/hannah-pingree-for-governor/', true),
  ('gov-me-pingree', 'm4a', 2, 'Supports a public option and expanding MaineCare; not single payer.', 'https://hannahforgovernor.com/', true),
  ('gov-me-bellows', 'democracy', 4, 'Removed Trump from the 2024 ballot under the 14th Amendment; voting rights champion.', null, true),
  ('gov-me-bellows', 'justice', 3, 'Former ACLU director; criminal justice reform record.', null, true),
  ('gov-me-bellows', 'm4a', 3, 'Supports single payer.', null, true),
  ('gov-me-king', 'gnd', 3, 'Clean-energy executive.', null, true),
  ('gov-me-king', 'no_corp_pac', 1, 'Business donor base.', null, true),
  ('gov-mn-klobuchar', 'antitrust', 4, 'Chaired the Senate antitrust subcommittee, authored the American Innovation and Choice Online Act targeting Big Tech self-preferencing, and cosponsors S.130, the Competition and Antitrust Law Enforcement Reform Act, and S.1879, the Ban Congressional Stock Trading Act. Breakups-oriented enforcement plus a stock ban.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/amy-klobuchar/K000367', false),
  ('gov-mn-klobuchar', 'gaza', 4, 'Voted Yea on the motion to discharge S.J.Res.34, blocking a $675.7 million offensive arms sale to Israel, July 30, 2025 (rejected 24-73). Had voted Nay on the November 20, 2024 S.J.Res.111 discharge motion, so the July 2025 Yea marks a shift toward blocking offensive transfers.', 'https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1191/vote_119_1_00455.htm', false),
  ('gov-mn-klobuchar', 'm4a', 1, 'Opposes Medicare for All; cosponsors S.2073, the State Public Option Act. Public option.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/amy-klobuchar/K000367', false),
  ('gov-mn-klobuchar', 'no_corp_pac', 1, 'Accepts corporate PAC money; no pledge.', 'https://www.congress.gov/member/amy-klobuchar/K000367', true),
